---
description: All comments and code must be in English
alwaysApply: true
---

# Language: English only

- **Comments**: Write all comments (single-line `//`, block `/* */`, JSDoc, and docstrings) in English.
- **Code**: Use English for variable names, function names, string literals shown to users or used in logic, error messages, log messages, and UI text (labels, placeholders, titles, descriptions).
- **Documentation**: Keep README, docs, and in-repo documentation in English.
- **Consistency**: Do not add French or other non-English text in source files; use English only.
